# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your free FRED API key, then run the
# app / report.  (".env" is git-ignored so your key is never committed.)
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # then edit .env and paste your key after the "=" below
#
# Get a key (free, ~1 minute): https://fredaccount.stlouisfed.org/apikeys
#
# This is the ONLY credential the project needs. Without it the app still
# runs — yfinance / Stooq prices and AAII / FINRA sentiment are all keyless —
# but the 5 FRED-based features (valuation CAPE/Buffett, VIX, margin debt +
# credit spread, M2 / Fed balance sheet, real fed-funds rate) will be missing
# and their weights are automatically redistributed across the others.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

FRED_API_KEY=
